#Use:
#BagManager for bag related stuff
#GameManager for saves, player info & variables
using GameManager
#SoundManager for sounds
using PManager 
#for portraits (soon)
#CurtainCall for cutscenes (soon)

~ start
Casimir: Hi, I'm Casimir Bohmuwey.
Casimir: [b]This[/b] [b][i]is just a[/i][/b] test dialogue...
Casimir: [i]Weird, why is the text so long?[/i]
do add_hour(1)
do set_true("show_time")
Casimir: Choose a Response...
- Option 1
	Casimir: You get a bloodberry!
	do BagManager.give_item("res://assets/bag/items/bloodberry.tres")
- Option 2
	Casimir: You can use the book now, wow!
#	do GameManager.unlocked_book = true
- Option 3
	if BagManager.has_item("Letter"):
#		Casimir: You suddenly dropped the letter!
#		do BagManager.take_item("res://assets/bag/items/letter.tres")
		do PManager.show("Casimir", "c_default", "CharacterA")
		Casimir: I am standing over on the left side!
		do PManager.show("Vivienne", "m_neutral", "CharacterC")
		Vivenne: And I am standing on the right-middle side. Casimir should look dim now!
		do PManager.show("Casimir", "c_smile", "CharacterA")
		Casimir: Yep! Now I lit right back up when I started talking again.
		do PManager.show("Vivienne", "m_neutral", "CharacterC")
		Vivienne: Hmmm, you know what? We can even try something fun!
		do PManager.show("Casimir", "c_conf", "CharacterA")
		Casimir: Huh? Like what?
		do show("Heinester", "h_neutral", "CharacterD")
		Heinester: Like showing me up!
		do show("Belomere", "b_neutral", "CharacterB")
		Belomere: Ah, four people in a screen...
		Belomere: Efficient.
		do PManager.show("Vivienne", "m_neutral", "CharacterC")
		do bounce("CharacterC")
		Vivienne: Oooh! That's [wave]soooo[/wave] cool!
		do hide_all()
	else:
		Casimir: Oh, you don't have the letter anymore.
- Option 4
	if is_true("interacted_table"):
		Casimir: I think I want the crafting one instead...
		set unlock_crafting = true
		do set_false("interacted_table")
	else:
		Casimir: I should go to the table first.
=> END

~ table
if not is_true("interacted_table") and unlock_crafting == false:
	Casimir: Huh, it's a magical cooking table.
	Casimir: I don't really have a use for it now.
	do set_true("interacted_table")
=> END

~ mailbox
do show("Casimir", "c_default", "CharacterA")
Casimir: There's no more mail.
do hide_all()
=> END

~ globe
do show("Casimir", "c_default", "CharacterA")
Casimir: This is a replica model of the world we live in, [b]Krubilei[/b].
do show("Casimir", "c_neutral", "CharacterA")
Casimir: Our world is created by the God of Destruction, Qhosthos.
do show("Casimir", "c_default", "CharacterA")
Casimir: But here in Cloudvale, our small town is watched over by an omniscent being we call the Prophet.
do hide_all()
=> END

~ desk
do show("Casimir", "c_smile", "CharacterA")
Casimir: These are photos of me and my childhood friend, Hein.
do show("Casimir", "c_default", "CharacterA")
Casimir: He lives a few steps away.
do hide_all()
=> END

~ wolframsbed
do show("Casimir", "c_smile", "CharacterA")
Casimir: This is Wolfram's side of the room.
Casimir: She isn't around right now, maybe she's by the beach right now.
do hide_all()
=> END

~ bed
if is_true("slept_bed"):
	=> sleeping
if is_true("interacted_true") and not is_true("slept_bed"):
	Casimir: Hmm… [wait=0.5]though, sleeping for an hour doesn’t sound so bad, does it..?
	- Maybe a little bit.. =>< sleeping
	- Nevermind. => END
else if not is_true("interacted_bed"):
	do show("Casimir", "c_default", "CharacterA")
	Casimir: This is my bed. When my parents [i]left[/i], I gave their stuff to a wandering merchant.
	Casimir: Now, all is left is mine. It saves up space, at least.
	Casimir: Mother always told me to fix the bed before I left the house.
	do show("Casimir", "c_worry", "CharacterA")
	Casimir: Well, now that I'm dying soon, I might as well do as she says.
	do show("Casimir", "c_neutral", "CharacterA")
	do set_true("interacted_true")
	Casimir: Hmm… [wait=0.5]though, sleeping for an hour doesn’t sound so bad, does it..?
	- Maybe a little bit.. => sleeping
	- Nevermind. => END
=> END

~ sleeping
# Add a cutscene here
if not is_true("slept_bed"):
	do set_true("slept_bed")
if is_true("slept_bed"):
	Casimir: I already slept before, should I sleep again?
	- Just a little more. => END!
	- Nevermind => END!
if is_true("slept_bed") and BagManager.has_item("Letter"):
	Casimir: I don't have enough time... should I seriously sleep again?
	- Just a little more... => END!
	- No, nevermind. => END!